    "Increase forecast sensitivity to sentiment shifts in the last 5 days — especially when sentiment turns positive after a dip.",
    "For long-term horizons (>14 days), reduce forecast volatility by smoothing with a 7-day moving average.",
    "When sentiment is neutral or mixed, prioritize historical trend alignment over sentiment-driven extrapolation."
